license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  KMCS is a lattice-based kinetic Monte Carlo model for pulsed thin-film
  growth. It supports single- and multi-material simulations, successive
  deposited layers, automated temperature-frequency studies, pillar-density
  analysis, and two- and three-dimensional visualization.
keywords:
  - kinetic Monte Carlo
  - thin-film growth
  - pulsed laser deposition
  - vertically aligned nanocomposites
  - multi-material simulation
  - design of experiments
